    <value>Control of the Xiaomi Smart Dehumidifier Lite.
The address and token are taken from the program settings (the same as in the window) or written before the commands.

  Dehumidifier.exe status                    state
  Dehumidifier.exe on                        switch on
  Dehumidifier.exe off                       switch off
  Dehumidifier.exe toggle                    toggle power
  Dehumidifier.exe humidity 40…70            target humidity, %
  Dehumidifier.exe mode smart|sleep|dry      mode: smart, sleep, clothes drying
  Dehumidifier.exe next                      next mode
  Dehumidifier.exe light on|off dim|bright   light: switch and (or) brightness
  Dehumidifier.exe sound on|off              button sound
  Dehumidifier.exe lock on|off               button lock
  Dehumidifier.exe dry-after-off on|off      drying after switch-off
  Dehumidifier.exe timer 1…65535|1:30|off    shutdown timer: minutes, hours:minutes or off
  Dehumidifier.exe reset-filter              reset the filter counter
  Dehumidifier.exe 2.5                       read MIoT property siid.piid
  Dehumidifier.exe 2.5=45                    write: a number, on|off or JSON
  Dehumidifier.exe 192.168.0.10 [token]      window with this dehumidifier; settings are not changed
  Dehumidifier.exe 192.168.0.10 token status  commands to this dehumidifier; settings are not changed

Russian synonyms: состояніе, включить, выключить, переключить, влажность, режимъ умный|ночной|сушка,
слѣдующій, подсвѣтка включить|выключить тусклая|яркая, звукъ, блокировка, просушка, таймеръ,
сбросъ-фильтра.

For light, the switch (on|off) and the brightness (dim|bright) are independent: give either or both,
in any order. light dim changes only the brightness, light on dim changes both:
  Dehumidifier.exe light on dim status

siid.piid is the MIoT property number, as under the labels in the window: this reads and writes
what the commands do not cover. Writing does not check the type or limits.

Several commands can be given in a row; they run in order:
  Dehumidifier.exe mode smart humidity 45 status
The whole line is checked first: if it has an error, nothing runs.
If the device refuses, execution stops at that command.
Without parameters the window opens.

A token written on the command line is visible to other programs on this computer and stays in the shell history.
To avoid that, connect once in the window: the address and token will be saved in the settings.

Exit code: 0 — success, 1 — connection error or device refusal, 2 — invalid command.</value>
